  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Integration Facility for Ukraine 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU:s Integrationsfacilitet f&#xf6;r Ukraina 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar en mekanism f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till Ukraina f&#xf6;r att uppfylla EUs K&#xf6;penhamnskriterier. De huvudsakliga mottagarna &#xe4;r vice premi&#xe4;rministerns kansli, regeringens kansli f&#xf6;r europeisk och euroatlantisk integration, sekretariatet f&#xf6;r Verkhovna Rada och Verkhovna Radas kommitt&#xe9; f&#xf6;r Ukrainas integration i Europeiska unionen. Mekanismen kommer att arbeta genom kapacitetsuppbyggnad, &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng till juridisk expertis om EU:s regelverk, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttningskapacitet och &#xf6;kad medvetenhet om EU-anslutningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution establishes a mechanism for the support to Ukraine to meet the Copenhagen Criteria. The main beneficiaries are the Deputy Prime Ministers Office, the Government Office for the European and Euro-Atlantic Integration, the Secretariat of the Verkhovna Rada of Ukraine and the Committee on Ukraine&#x2019;s Integration into European Union of the Verkhovna Rada. The Mechanism will work through capacity building, increased access to legal expertise into the EU Acquis, enhanced capacities for translation and raised awareness on the EU Accession.</narrative>
  </description>
